# Custom IR scancode mappings
#
# Add mappings here for remote buttons not handled by the
# built-in map. Built-in mappings always take priority and
# cannot be overridden.
#
# Format:
# <scancode> <keycode> [description]
#
# Use hexadecimal scancodes and Linux key names or numeric
# keycodes. Restart ir_daemon after making changes.
#
# Do not modify ir_map.h entries here; custom mappings are
# additive only.